Package: drm-mali
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         libgralloc1,
         libegl1
Description: DRM ioctl shim for Mali/HWC2 on FuriOS
 LD_PRELOAD shim intercepting DRM ioctls which fail against the Mali
 DRM driver on FuriOS devices. Presentation is handled by Android HWC2.
 .
 Tested on MT6877 (Dimensity 900, Mali-G68 MC4) running FuriOS.
